<div class="ph-eyebrow rv"><span class="s">&#10022;</span>Details <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Pricing<span class="rule"></span></div><h1 class="ph-h1 rv">Fixed prices.<br>Fast delivery.<br><em>Maximum quality.</em></h1><p class="ph-lead rv">Exactly what you get at each stage of the Brand Journey, and what it costs.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="pr-sec ddrop-wrap-sec"><div class="section-inner"><div class="ddrop-float"><button class="ddrop-bar ddrop-master-bar" id="ddrop-master-bar" onclick="ddropToggle('master')" aria-expanded="false"><span class="ddrop-bar-left"><span class="ddrop-bar-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.2"/><path d="M15.6 8.4l-2.3 5.5-5.5 2.3 2.3-5.5z"/></svg></span><span class="ddrop-bar-txt"><strong>Start with the why &amp; the how</strong><span class="ddrop-bar-sub">Two quick reads before the prices. Why brands rebrand, and the exact six-phase process.</span></span></span><span class="ddrop-bar-right"><span class="ddrop-phase-mini" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--mc:#3B82F6"></i><i style="--mc:#6366F1"></i><i style="--mc:#8B5CF6"></i><i style="--mc:#EC4899"></i><i style="--mc:#F59E0B"></i><i style="--mc:#14B8A6"></i></span><span class="ddrop-bar-count">2 reads</span><span class="ddrop-bar-chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 4.5 7 9.5 12 4.5"/></svg></span></span></button><div class="ddrop-panel ddrop-master-panel" id="ddrop-master"><div class="ddrop-inner"><button class="ddrop-bar open" id="ddrop-trig-bar" onclick="ddropToggle('trig')" aria-expanded="true"><span class="ddrop-bar-left"><span class="ddrop-bar-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.5 12a8.5 8.5 0 1 1-2.6-6.1"/><path d="M20.7 4.3v4.4h-4.4"/></svg></span><span class="ddrop-bar-txt"><strong>Why rebrand? The Trigger Framework</strong><span class="ddrop-bar-sub">12 strategic triggers. Which one applies to your business?</span></span></span><span class="ddrop-bar-right"><span class="ddrop-bar-count">12 reasons</span><span class="ddrop-bar-chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 4.5 7 9.5 12 4.5"/></svg></span></span></button><div class="ddrop-panel open" id="ddrop-trig"><div class="ddrop-inner"><div class="rv"><div class="section-tag"><span class="s">&#10022;</span>The Trigger Framework</div><h2 class="section-title">Is it time to <em>rebrand?</em></h2><p class="section-sub">Every rebrand has a root cause. If one of these sounds like your business, this is exactly what the Brand Journey is built to fix.</p></div><div class="trig-legend rv"><span class="trig-leg" style="--lc:#ff5a5f"><i></i>External trigger</span><span class="trig-leg" style="--lc:#3a55e8"><i></i>Strategic</span><span class="trig-leg" style="--lc:#7a4ee8"><i></i>Brand equity</span><span class="trig-leg" style="--lc:#f5b301"><i></i>Performance</span></div><div class="trig-acc"><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#ff5a5f"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20h16M7 20V5l7-2v17M7 9h7M7 13h7"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">01</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">External</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Forced by corporate change</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">New leadership, an ownership transfer, or a company pivot forces a brand reset to match the new direction.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#3a55e8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v7M12 10l-6 6M12 10l6 6M6 16v3M18 16v3"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">02</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Strategic</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Structural realignment</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">Spin-offs, splits, or portfolio restructuring mean each entity needs its own distinct, standalone identity.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#ff5a5f"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 21V4M6 5h11l-2 4 2 4H6"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">03</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">External</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Forced by competition</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">A competitor rebranded or entered your space. Staying put means being confused with them, or losing your edge.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#3a55e8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6"/><path d="M20 20l-4.6-4.6"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">04</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Strategic</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Market insight & gaps</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">Research found an underserved niche. The rebrand repositions you to own that space before a rival does.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#7a4ee8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 12s4-6.5 10-6.5S22 12 22 12s-4 6.5-10 6.5S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">05</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Brand Equity</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">A change of perception</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">The brand reads low-quality, old-priced, or wrong-audience. A rebrand signals the business has truly changed.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#f5b301"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5v15h16"/><path d="M19 9l-5 5-3-3-4 4"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">06</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Performance</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Forced by performance</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">Sales are slipping, leads are weak, conversion is low. The brand is failing to attract or close the right clients.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#3a55e8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.3-5.6"/><path d="M20 4.4v4h-4"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">07</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Strategic</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Product life cycle</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">You expanded into new products or services the current brand can no longer contain. The architecture needs an update.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#7a4ee8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20C7 16.5 4 13.5 4 9.5A3.4 3.4 0 0 1 12 7a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 8 2.5c0 4-3 7-8 10.5z"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">08</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Brand Equity</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">More relevant & authentic</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">The brand feels dated or off from who you have actually become. The identity needs to catch up.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#7a4ee8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 8h16M6 12h12M9 16h6"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">09</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Brand Equity</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">The need to simplify</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">A confusing message or cluttered logo. The rebrand strips it back to one clear, ownable idea that sells itself.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#3a55e8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.6-3 7.7-7 9.6C8 18.7 5 15.6 5 11V6z"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">10</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Strategic</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Clearer intellectual property</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">To trademark, license, or franchise, the brand must be distinctive enough to protect and scale legally.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#3a55e8"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="0.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">11</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">Strategic</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Align with corporate strategy</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">New 3 to 5 year goals or investor commitments need the brand to signal ambition and credibility.</p></div><div class="trig-acc-item rv" style="--tc:#ff5a5f"><span class="trig-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5l6.5 6.5V20M19 5l-6 6"/></svg></span><div class="trig-acc-meta"><span class="trig-acc-num">12</span><span class="trig-acc-tag">External</span></div><h4 class="trig-acc-title">Mergers & de-mergers</h4><p class="trig-acc-d">Two companies combining, or one splitting off, creates identity conflict. A unified or separated brand removes it.</p></div></div></div></div><button class="ddrop-bar open" id="ddrop-phase-bar" onclick="ddropToggle('phase')" aria-expanded="true"><span class="ddrop-bar-left"><span class="ddrop-bar-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="5.6" cy="6" r="2.4"/><circle cx="18.4" cy="18" r="2.4"/><path d="M8 6h7.1a3.3 3.3 0 0 1 0 6.6H8.9a3.3 3.3 0 0 0 0 6.6h7.1"/></svg></span><span class="ddrop-bar-txt"><strong>The six phases of the Brand Journey</strong><span class="ddrop-bar-sub">Our exact process, from the first audit through to launch and beyond.</span></span></span><span class="ddrop-bar-right"><span class="ddrop-bar-count">6 phases</span><span class="ddrop-bar-chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 4.5 7 9.5 12 4.5"/></svg></span></span></button><div class="ddrop-panel open" id="ddrop-phase"><div class="ddrop-inner"><div class="proc6 rv"><div class="proc6-rail"><button class="proc6-tab active" data-ph="0" style="--pc:#3B82F6"><span class="proc6-n">1</span><span class="proc6-nm">Audit</span><span class="proc6-dur">1 wk</span></button><button class="proc6-tab" data-ph="1" style="--pc:#6366F1"><span class="proc6-n">2</span><span class="proc6-nm">Strategy</span><span class="proc6-dur">2 wks</span></button><button class="proc6-tab" data-ph="2" style="--pc:#8B5CF6"><span class="proc6-n">3</span><span class="proc6-nm">Identity</span><span class="proc6-dur">2 wks</span></button><button class="proc6-tab" data-ph="3" style="--pc:#EC4899"><span class="proc6-n">4</span><span class="proc6-nm">Playbook</span><span class="proc6-dur">4 wks</span></button><button class="proc6-tab" data-ph="4" style="--pc:#F59E0B"><span class="proc6-n">5</span><span class="proc6-nm">Conversion</span><span class="proc6-dur">1-2 mo</span></button><button class="proc6-tab" data-ph="5" style="--pc:#14B8A6"><span class="proc6-n">6</span><span class="proc6-nm">Engage</span><span class="proc6-dur">ongoing</span></button></div><div class="proc6-stage"><div class="proc6-panel active" data-pp="0" style="--pc:#3B82F6"><div class="proc6-phead"><span class="proc6-badge">Phase 1 &middot; 1 wk</span><h3>Audit</h3><span class="proc6-psub">Discover &amp; diagnose</span></div><div class="proc6-body"><div class="proc6-block"><span class="proc6-lab">What you walk away with</span><p>Know exactly what is broken, and why.</p></div><div class="proc6-block"><span class="proc6-lab">Headline deliverable</span><p class="proc6-deliv">Full brand audit findings</p></div></div><div class="proc6-tree"><span class="proc6-lab">Everything delivered in this phase <em>20 deliverables</em></span><div class="proc6-groups"><div class="proc6-grp"><span class="proc6-grp-t">Audit · 15A</span><div class="proc6-chips"><span class="proc6-chip">BI Triangle</span><span class="proc6-chip">Timeline Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Goal Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Visual Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Verbal Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Behavioural Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Competition Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Peer Audit</span><span class="proc6-chip">Touchpoint</span></div></div><div class="proc6-grp"><span class="proc6-grp-t">Name 